  "rules": [
    "Stage families are parallel processes and source-defined states, not a universal linear funnel.",
    "Power generation queues and customer load applications use distinct populations and keys.",
    "IT MW, gross facility MW, leasable/billed MW, synchronous peak MW, non-coincident peak MW, MWh and GPU equivalents are not additive.",
    "Entity headquarters coordinates never stand in for manufacturing/data-center site coordinates.",
    "Roles belong to each transaction/event; a semiconductor firm may buy materials and sell chips in distinct contracts.",
    "Application links, named contracts, forecasts, expert assessments, company disclosures, measured quantities and author estimates remain separate.",
    "Do not write new named relationships into the baseline graph from unverified aggregate/model links.",
    "PJM annual large-load XLS and report monthly DC charts are separate metrics and populations."
  ],
